/* 数据层词条：牌型/报法/玩法/播报词（中文 key -> 英文） */
"                底牌为色，再根据色牌的点数去面牌，报最大" = "                Bottom card is marked, then discard face cards by the marked card's points, announce highest";
"                底牌为色，再根据色牌的点数去面牌，报最大次大" = "                Bottom card is marked, then discard face cards by the marked card's points, announce highest and second highest";
"                底牌为色，再根据色牌的点数去面牌，报最小" = "                Bottom card is marked, then discard face cards by the marked card's points, announce lowest";
"                底牌为色，再根据色牌的点数去面牌，报最小次小" = "                Bottom card is marked, then discard face cards by the marked card's points, announce lowest and second lowest";
"        底2张相加为色:比如底2张是7和9。7+9=16，最终色=16-10=6点。比如:报1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报 1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换，可保位置最大" = "        Bottom 2 cards added up as the mark: e.g. the bottom 2 cards are 7 and 9. 7+9=16, final mark = 16-10 = 6 points. E.g.: announce 1,2 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of deal round 1, locks position highest. Announce 1,2;2,3 = swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of round 1 and the 3rd and 4th cards of round 2, locks position highest";
"        报去掉多少张面牌，可保位置最大。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10。表示在上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1,Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最大。男声 0=找不到满足条件的牌" = "        Announces how many face cards to discard to lock position highest. The discard range is set by X and Y: default X=1,Y=10, meaning discard face cards within the top 10 cards. Change to X=1,Y=5 to discard within the first 5 cards. Female voice 0 = position highest is locked without discarding. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition";
"        报在第几张牌处打色，色牌先发，可保位置最大。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10表示在上 10张内打色。修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色" = "        Announces which card to mark; the marked card is dealt first, locking position highest. The mark range is set by X and Y: default X=1,Y=10 means mark within the top 10 cards. Change to X=5,Y=10 to mark between the 5th and 10th cards";
"        报在第几张牌处打色，色牌先发，可保位置最大次大。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10。表示在上10张内打色。修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色" = "        Announces which card to mark; the marked card is dealt first, locking position highest and second highest. The mark range is set by X and Y: default X=1,Y=10, meaning mark within the top 10 cards. Change to X=5,Y=10 to mark between the 5th and 10th cards";
"        报在第几张牌处打色，色牌先发，可保位置最小。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内打色。修改为:X=5，Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色。" = "        Announces which card to mark; the marked card is dealt first, locking position lowest. The mark range is set by X and Y: default X=1,Y=10, meaning mark within the top 10 cards. Change to X=5,Y=10 to mark between the 5th and 10th cards.";
"        报在第几张牌处打色，色牌先发，可保位置最小次小。打色范围有参数XY设定: 默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内打色X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色" = "        Announces which card to mark; the marked card is dealt first, locking position lowest and second lowest. The mark range is set by X and Y: default X=1,Y=10, meaning mark within the top 10 cards; X=5,Y=10 means mark between the 5th and 10th cards";
"        梭哈专用。报去掉多少张面牌，可保位置最大。优先保位置有最大对子。按报下轮，报后续4张单张数字。去面牌范围由X，Y决定。默认X=1,Y=10.表示在 上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1,Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最大。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌" = "        Show Hand only. Announces how many face cards to discard to lock position highest, giving priority to the position holding the highest Pair. Tap Announce Next Round to hear the numbers of the following 4 single cards. The discard range is set by X and Y: default X=1,Y=10, meaning discard face cards within the top 10 cards. Change to X=1,Y=5 to discard within the first 5 cards. Female voice 0 = position highest is locked without discarding. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition";
"        比如报24，表示去掉2张面牌补到底部可保第3门第4门是最大次大，最大家是4。保34门, 去面牌的数量由XY设定。" = "        E.g. announcing 24 means discarding 2 face cards to the bottom locks gate 3 and gate 4 as highest and second highest, with player 4 the highest. Locks gates 3 and 4; the number of face cards discarded is set by X and Y.";
"        比如报24，表示去掉2张面牌补到底部可保第3门第4门是最大，最大家是4。保34门, 去面牌的数量由XY设定。" = "        E.g. announcing 24 means discarding 2 face cards to the bottom locks gate 3 and gate 4 as highest, with player 4 the highest. Locks gates 3 and 4; the number of face cards discarded is set by X and Y.";
